NWTPMSG {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1;36mNew global chat channel topic for channel <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_CHATCHAN> <ESC>[36m: <ESC>[32m<TV:GLO_TOPIC>
} T New global chat channel topic message

 This message informs all users in a global chat channel
 that the topic has been cleared, and who cleared the
 topic.

CLRTPMSG {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1;36mGlobal chat channel topic for channel <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_CHATCHAN> <ESC>[36mhas been cleared by <ESC>[33m<TV:GLO_USERID><ESC>[37m.
} T Global chat channel topic clearing message

