TPNWMSG {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1;36mNew global chat channel topic for channel <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_CHATCHAN> <ESC>[36mhas been changed to "<ESC>[32m<TV:GLO_TOPIC><ESC>[36m" by <ESC>[33m<TV:GLO_USERID><ESC>[36m.
} T Global chat channel topic changing message

 This is the output to a user using the Display all global
