ALLCNMSG {<ESC>[0;1;33m<TV:GLO_USERID:L:25>    <ESC>[36m<TV:GLO_CHATCHAN:L:5>           <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_TOPIC>
} T Display all global chat channels output

 This message tells the user that his global chat is turned
