CCOFFH {<ESC>[1;36mType <ESC>[33m<TV:GLO_CMD><ESC>[36m to come back to channel <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_COUNT><ESC>[36m.
} T Chat off: how to turn it back on

 A user asked to turn chat on while already on a channel.

CCALON {<ESC>[0m
