 This is the main telegram option menu of selections.

TMMSG {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1;36;44m(<ESC>[37mR<ESC>[36m)eply (<ESC>[37mS<ESC>[36m)how again (<ESC>[37mN<ESC>[36m)ext (<ESC>[37mE<ESC>[36m)xit<ESC>[0m } T Main telegram option menu

 This is a message confirming to the user that his telegram
