TRCMSG {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1m<TV:GLO_USERID> <ESC>[34mhas just written a telegram to you.
Type <ESC>[33m<TV:GLO_GTLSTG> <ESC>[34mto read it.
} T Telegram written to user message

 This message informs the user that he has no more
