HICRDMSG {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1;35mYou may only post from <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_MIN> <ESC>[35mto <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_MAX> <ESC>[35mcredits.
} T Invalid amount of posted credits message

 This message is displayed at log-on to users who have a
