MULTUSR {<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[1;35m"<ESC>[33m<TV:GLO_USERID><ESC>[35m" is a possible match for more than one user on-line. You need to be
more specific. For example, you might have entered "<ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_PGUSTG> <ESC>[35ms hey!" when the
users "Sparky" and "Starlight" are on-line. Entering "<ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_PGUSTG> <ESC>[35msp hey!" would
allow your page to reach "Sparky".
} T Vague user-id for page entered message

