CLRNUM2 {<ESC>[0;1;33m<TV:GLO_CHATSTG> <TV:GLO_CLRSTG> # #    Clears channel range from # to # where # is in range of <ESC>[37m1 <ESC>[33mto <ESC>[37m<TV:GLO_MAX>
} T Clear chat channel command usage message (2 of 2)

